# Streamlit
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Run artifacts. Every run writes case, split, hashes, criteria version, prompt
# and model versions, settings, stage outcomes, tokens, timing, retries, and
# final output.
#
# Most are intermediate or superseded and stay out. The runs that back a
# reported number are tracked, for two reasons found by testing a clone
# rather than assuming:
#
#   1. `tests/test_faults.py` replays a real truncation out of
#      20260910T205411Z_eval_batch8_A.json. With `runs/` fully ignored the
#      suite fails on a fresh clone.
#   2. The interface reads `runs/*.json` and calls `st.stop()` when it finds
#      none, so a clone with no artifacts cannot open recorded mode — the
#      one mode that works without a key.
#
# Every run below the thinking fix of 2026-09-10 is invalidated and excluded;
# see docs/DATA_CARD.md. `runs/live/` is a demonstration output, never an
# evaluation input, and is not tracked.
runs/*
!runs/README.md

# Three single-case runs. `tests/test_verify.py` replays their recorded
# quotes against the packets to confirm every span still resolves, and globs
# for `*<case>*.json`, which the batch artifacts do not match. Without these
# that test skips silently on a clone, which is lost coverage wearing the
# costume of a pass. They predate the extended-thinking fix and so are not
# valid for any timing or quality number; they are used here only to check
# that recorded spans still resolve, which that fix does not affect.
!runs/20260910T034251Z_MRI-005_A.json
!runs/20260910T153901Z_TKA-004_A.json
!runs/20260910T154202Z_MRI-004_A.json

# The truncation replayed by the fault injection control.
!runs/20260910T205411Z_eval_batch8_A.json

# Development, Baseline A and Candidate B.
!runs/20260910T213858Z_eval_batch7_A.json
!runs/20260910T213538Z_eval_batch8_A.json
!runs/20260910T222444Z_eval_batch7_B.json
!runs/20260910T221928Z_eval_batch8_B.json

# Held-out test, both configurations. The adoption decision rests here.
!runs/20260910T223110Z_eval_batch5_A.json
!runs/20260910T223755Z_eval_batch4_A.json
!runs/20260910T224634Z_eval_batch5_B.json
!runs/20260910T225318Z_eval_batch4_B.json

# Transfer, and the claim-verification set.
!runs/20260910T230714Z_eval_transfer_A.json
!runs/20260910T233307Z_claimset.json

# Prompt injection challenge, both runs and both arms.
!runs/20260911T001324Z_injection_challenge.json
!runs/20260911T001751Z_injection_challenge_unfenced.json
!runs/20260911T002810Z_injection_challenge.json
!runs/20260911T002922Z_injection_challenge_unfenced.json

*.log

